  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Apple more than tripled and Amazon nearly tripled, while Citigroup lost almost nine-tenths of its value. Bonds gained; the international share basket fell. The financial company’s losses at the start were a warning, but the size of its later decline was not written in the announcement.",
