  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "Citigroup changed leaders after mortgage losses. Kindle, driverless cars and distant planets offered very different kinds of news.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "A large, well-known financial institution could still suffer an enormous loss. A broad basket reduced reliance on one company, though it could also lose value.",
    "what_faded_away": "A change at the top did not instantly fix a bank’s problems. A new gadget did not make its maker’s future return certain.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "Nobody knew the exact recovery paths or losses. Company size and a familiar name were not substitutes for allowing for risk.",
